"We see that when we have no spend, the contribution is zero (assuming "
"there was no spend in the past, otherwise the carryover effect would be "
"non-zero)."
msgstr ""
"Vemos que cuando no hay gasto, la contribución es cero (suponiendo que no "
"hubo gasto en el pasado; de lo contrario, el efecto de arrastre no sería "
